    {
      "v": 2,
      "zh": "大卫说：「我要照哈嫩的父亲拿辖厚待我的恩典厚待哈嫩。」于是大卫差遣使者为他丧父安慰他。大卫的臣仆到了亚扪人的境内见哈嫩，要安慰他，",
      "en": "David said, “I will express my loyalty[NOTE:1] to Hanun son of Nahash, for his father was loyal[NOTE:2] to me.” So David sent messengers to express his sympathy over his father’s death.[NOTE:3] When David’s servants entered Ammonite territory to visit Hanun and express the king’s sympathy,[NOTE:4]",
      "notes": [
