    {
      "v": 5,
      "zh": "有人将臣仆所遇的事告诉大卫，他就差人去迎接他们，因为他们甚觉羞耻；告诉他们说：「可以住在耶利哥，等到胡须长起再回来。」",
      "en": "People[NOTE:1] came and told David what had happened to the men, so he sent messengers to meet them, for the men were thoroughly humiliated. The king said, “Stay in Jericho[NOTE:2] until your beards grow again; then you may come back.”",
